                                                 rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Object ;
                                                 rdfs:comment """This concept is inherited from Ontology for General Medical Science (OGMS), and has as definition \"A structurally anomalous part of an organism acquired during fetal development and present at birth (but not necessarily hereditary) which is hypothesized to be harmful for the organism.\"

