                                                 rdfs:comment """Inherited from the Phenotype and Trait Ontology (PATO), has as definition \"A quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the whether the bearer differs from normal or average.\"

Because the it concerns single individuals (the bearer), it will be transformed, according to Transformation Pattern #9, to gUFO:Quality. However, it is understable by the definition and usage that the deviation is the quality of a quality - which is not supported by BFO.""" ;
                                                 rdfs:label "deviation" .


